Antigravity Usage & Speed Monitor (with Obsidian Prism Optical UI Suite)
================================================================================

This distribution incorporates and adapts optical UI, motion, workbench,
effort-slider, Omni viewer, Home Studio, wallpaper, and pixel-mascot modules
from Obsidian Prism, alongside the security-hardened Usage & Speed Monitor
telemetry engine.

  - Upstream Optical UI Project: Obsidian Prism (黑曜棱镜)
  - Upstream Author:           RMvdesi
  - Upstream Source:           https://github.com/RMvdesi/obsidian-prism
  - Copyright:                 Copyright (C) 2026 RMvdesi

  - Usage Monitor Copyright:   Copyright (C) 2026 yuhuan-dev & StickwoodJr
  - Usage Monitor Source:      https://github.com/StickwoodJr/antigravity-usage-monitor

